      "support": [
        "XRP Insights reports +105.9M all-exchange same-wallet change on Oct 31 after -207.3M on Oct 30.",
        "Its Binance-attributed wallets show +17.6M over seven days and +30.3M over 30 days, with 2.78B XRP on Oct 31."
      ],
      "disconfirming": [
        "XRP Insights and CryptoQuant use different wallet universes and time windows.",
